{"synopsis":"Aku, seorang budak yang bereinkarnasi menjadi seorang bangsawan di dalam game.\n\nTapi katanya aku cuma karakter figuran yang nanti akan mati dibunuh oleh para penjahat masa depan?\n\nTidak bisa begitu! Aku akan menuntun mereka ke jalan yang benar dan menikmati hidup mewah sebagai bangsawan!\n\nUntuk mencegah para calon penjahat kecil itu berubah menjadi jahat, aku menjadi dermawan dan membantu mereka mengatasi lingkungan yang keras.\n\nHasilnya? Mereka semua tumbuh menjadi anak-anak yang luar biasa dan… sepenuhnya normal.\n\nNamun pada akhirnya...\n\nAku malah menjadi dalang terakhir dari kerajaan.\n\n…Hah?","alternative_title":"악당들의 후원자가 되었다","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","chapters":[{"number":"46","chapter":"46","slug":"6a89d619-1406-4bff-96d8-ef86d191ecab","date":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"number":"45","chapter":"45","slug":"5f439c3d-44b2-4b24-a7d0-9c7ad2a56742","date":"2026-07-24","images":[]},{"number":"44","chapter":"44","slug":"9b527bcd-ae56-4752-865e-be2118a69768","date":"2026-07-17","images":[]},{"number":"43","chapter":"43","slug":"98f375f2-47dc-4320-9b95-f1f7b4c37b47","date":"2026-07-10","images":[]},{"number":"42","chapter":"42","slug":"80af9a8d-b80b-464e-b804-806614aa91bd","date":"2026-07-03","images":[]},{"number":"41","chapter":"41","slug":"e927bed1-ca38-420b-88b5-773cc769edab","date":"2026-06-26","images":[]},{"number":"40","chapter":"40","slug":"7ce4d978-1e76-4a8a-a4a4-1d945d89f270","date":"2026-06-19","images":[]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"d1aee78f-7071-47f6-8392-7825572196b7","date":"2026-06-12","images":[]},{"number":"38","chapter":"38","slug":"ec7ee40a-ee11-40ec-ac0f-3436d7f653fe","date":"2026-06-05","images":[]},{"number":"37","chapter":"37","slug":"a435f46a-9402-4d2f-afe4-8e0d33b5bfb4","date":"2026-05-29","images":[]},{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"fd00914a-1d76-44ae-be2f-be12637ff1ac","date":"2026-05-22","images":[]},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"9453fd91-c948-4013-8f34-5bb115d374f6","date":